# The gallery and the Prompt view need no key. Dashboard generation needs one of:
# THESYS_API_KEY: an inference key from https://console.thesys.dev/keys (OpenUI Gateway).
#   Optional THESYS_BASE_URL overrides the Gateway URL (OPENAI_BASE_URL is never used with it).
# OPENAI_API_KEY: any OpenAI-compatible key; set OPENAI_BASE_URL for other providers.
# Optional: OPENUI_MODEL. Defaults: openai/gpt-5.5 on Gateway, gpt-5.5 on OpenAI.
